# ai-videos — project conventions

## What this repo is

Remotion app for programmatic presentation videos. Presentations live under `presentations/`. Shared motion UI lives under `src/kit/`.

## Before coding

1. Read `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-25-remotion-presentation-system-design.md` if touching architecture.
2. Use Remotion agent skills (`remotion-best-practices` / `remotion-markup`) for Remotion APIs.
3. Use project skill `remotion-presentation` when adding or editing decks.

## Hard rules

- Pin Remotion packages to **exact** versions (no `^`).
- Animate kit components from **local** `useCurrentFrame()` so they work inside `Sequence`.
- Register every presentation in `src/Root.tsx` with format variants from `src/formats.ts`.
- Dark product UI tokens only via `src/kit/theme.ts` — no Inter/Roboto/Arial/system stacks; no purple-glow defaults.
- Do not invent a script→audio auto-pipeline unless the user explicitly asks (v2).

## Commands

- Studio: `npm run studio` (or bun equivalent) → `http://localhost:3000`
- Viewer: `npm run viewer` → local gallery
